                <pb facs="0354" n="266" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg266"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/2848: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Chile</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Culbertson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-02-02T15:00:00-05:00">February 2, 1933—3
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>12. As soon as Cruchaga returns from Mendoza endeavor discreetly to find out
                    result of his conversation with Argentine Minister of Foreign Affairs especially
                    as regards the Chaco.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
